, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Fera told me. I've been expecting you "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["three actually.\\. I am Yuuka, I suppose "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["you could say I'm in charge of this "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["place."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Original Player Face", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["So Fera is here..."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Shrine Maiden Faceset 2", 1, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Oh yes, she's staying with us for now.\\."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["I'm afraid I can't say the same for you."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Unfortunately I'm going to have to ask "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["you all to leave."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Kim Face Set 1", 5, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["But we just got here. We were invited in!"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Shrine Maiden Faceset 2", 1, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Yes, but on reflection I have decided to "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["turn you away. I'm sorry you couldn't "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["spend the evening us. "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Shrine Maiden Faceset 2", 1, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["I hear there is a brothel in Mirane "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["however. Perhaps they will be happy to "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["accomdate you."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Original Player Face", 2, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Hold up. We're not leaving, we came to "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["find Fera."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Shrine Maiden Faceset 2", 3, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["And that's why you must leave,\\. you're "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["well known to be...\\.messy.\\. And we'd"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["prefer if you didn't cause a commotion"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["for us. I suggest you forget about Fera."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Original Player Face", 4, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Not happening."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Shrine Maiden Faceset 2", 0, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["*sigh*\\. I tried to be nice. Suzume, "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["please escort them off the premises."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 212, "parameters": [16, 144, false]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 230, "parameters": [2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 205, "parameters": [16, {"repeat": false, "skippable": false, "wait": true, "list": [{"code": 45, "parameters": ["self_switch(\"A\",true)"]}, {"code": 0, "parameters": []}]}]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 505, "parameters": [[{"code": 45, "parameters": ["self_switch(\"A\",true)"]}, {"code": 0, "parameters": []}]]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 230, "parameters": [120]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 301, "parameters": [0, 101, false, true]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 601, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 1, "code": 0, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 603, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 1, "code": 0, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 604, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Original Player Face", 4, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["\\}Seriously?"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 221, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 314, "parameters": [0, 0]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 201, "parameters": [0, 143, 20, 10, 2, 0]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 217, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 108, "parameters": ["<move character: -2>"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 205, "parameters": [-1, {"repeat": false, "skippable": false, "wait": true, "