ke that again.\\. Wait, are you thinking-\\."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Original Player Face", 0, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Yep."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Dominic Faceset 2", 2, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Uh...what are we thinking? Explain "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["please."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Kim Face Set 4", 1, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Did you notice anything odd about that "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["room we were in?"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Dominic Faceset 2", 3, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Not really. I was a little...\\.distracted."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Sorry."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Kim Face Set 4", 1, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["For one thing, it was upstairs. The "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["building we entered into only has one "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["floor.\\. Secondly, I could smell cherry "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["blossoms."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Dominic Faceset 2", 4, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["But all the trees here are-\\.Oh. We were "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["teleported somewhere right?"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Original Player Face", 0, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Exactly. Apparently the shrine maidens "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["live in the woods, and I'm guessing "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["that's where we were just now. Which"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["means, there's another way in."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 111, "parameters": [0, 248, 0]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Dominic Faceset 2", 4, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["The woods? Thats the place with all "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["the fairies isn't it?"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Kim Face Set 5", 1, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Unfortunately."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Original Player Face", 4, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Yeah, I don't like it either. "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["But we have to save Fera."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Dominic Faceset 2", 4, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["That woman did mention there's a "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["brothel around here though, right?"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Kim Face Set 5", 1, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["What happened to you being "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["so 'gung-ho' on saving Fera?"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Dominic Faceset 2", 5, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["I know, I know. It's just...fairies."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Original Player Face", 4, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Hopefully we'll be able to get to the "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["shrine before they notice us."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 0, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 411, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Dominic Faceset 2", 4, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Through the woods.\\. The magical, dangerous "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["woods.\\. Well, I'm game. Although, that "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["woman did mention a brothel here right?"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Kim Face Set 5", 1, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["What happened to you being "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["so 'gung-ho' on saving Fera?"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Dominic Faceset 2", 5, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Right. Right."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Kim Face Set 6", 1, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Come on \\n[1], if we move now we "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["might be able to bring Dominic along "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["before he gets \"distracted\" again."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 0, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 412, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 205, "parameters": [-1, {"repeat": false, "skippable": false, "wait": true, "list": [{"code": 29, "parameters": [4]}, {"code": 0, "parameters": []}]}]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 505, "parameters": [[{"code": 29, "parameters": [4]}, {"code": 0, "parameters": []}]]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 122, "parameters": [37, 37, 0, 0, 137]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 0, "parameters": []}], "moveFrequency": 3, "moveRoute": {"repeat": true, "skippable": false, "wait": false, "list": [{"code": 0, "parameters": []}]}, "moveSpeed": 3, "moveType": 0, "priorityType": 0, "stepAnime": false, "through": false, "trigger": 0, "walkAnime": true, "image": {"tileId": 0, "characterName": "", "characterIndex": 0, "direction": 2, "pattern": 0}}]}, {"id": 15, "name": "Shrine Mistress", "x": 15, "y": 6, "pages": [{"conditions": {"switch1Valid": false, "switch2Valid": false, "variableValid": false, "selfSwitchValid": true, "itemValid": false, "actorValid": false, "switch1Id": 1, "switch2Id": 1, "variableId": 1, "variableValue": 0, "selfSwitchCh": "A", "itemId": 1, "actorId": 1}, "directionFix": false, "list": [{"indent": 0, "code": 0, "parameters": []}], "moveFrequency": 3, "moveRoute": {"repeat": true, "skippable": false, "wait": false, "list": [{"code": 0, "parameters": []}]}, "moveSpeed": 3, "moveType": 0, "priorityType": 1, "stepAnime": false, "through": false, "trigger": 0, "walkAnime": false, "image": {"tileId": 0, "charac